**Slice:** P3.3 tree lazy/paginated loading at every depth (first unmet acceptance gap).

**What changed** (`packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents`):
- New pure lib `src/lib/document-tree-loading.ts` + 10 tests — cursor-page merge/dedupe, first-load vs load-more boundaries, visited-guarded nested rebuild.
